# .trivyignore — suppressions for Trivy config scans run in pr-checks.yml.
#
# Format: one entry per line. Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#   AVD-AWS-0001                    # suppress a check ID globally
#   AVD-AWS-0001 exp:2026-12-31     # suppress until an expiry date (recommended)
#
# Always pair a suppression with a comment explaining why it is safe and, ideally,
# an `exp:` date so the suppression doesn't outlive its justification. Trivy will
# stop honoring the entry past the expiry, which forces a review.
#
# Reference: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/
